## HARDWARE DRIVER RULES

### R-HW-01: Timeout trên mọi hardware call (CỨNG)
```csharp
// MỌI motion/vision call phải có timeout
var cts = CancellationTokenSource.CreateLinkedTokenSource(ct);
cts.CancelAfter(TimeSpan.FromMilliseconds(timeoutMs));
try
{
    await WaitForMotionCompleteAsync(cts.Token);
}
catch (OperationCanceledException) when (!ct.IsCancellationRequested)
{
    throw new AlarmException(AlarmCode.MOTION_TIMEOUT, axisName);
}
```

### R-HW-02: Không gọi hardware từ UI thread (CỨNG)
- Hardware call PHẢI chạy trong background Task
- Kết quả trả về UI qua Dispatcher hoặc binding

### R-HW-03: Dispose hardware resources
```csharp
public class LtdmcController : IMotionController, IDisposable
{
    private bool _disposed;
    public void Dispose()
    {
        if (_disposed) return;
        LTDMC.GT_Close(); // Giải phóng hardware
        _disposed = true;
    }
}
```

---

## WPFUI / MVVM RULES

### R-UI-01: ViewModel không import UI namespaces (CỨNG)
```csharp
// ❌ ViewModel KHÔNG được import
using System.Windows;
using System.Windows.Controls;

// ✅ ViewModel chỉ dùng
using CommunityToolkit.Mvvm.ComponentModel;
using CommunityToolkit.Mvvm.Input;
```

### R-UI-02: PropertyChanged từ background thread
```csharp
// ❌ SAI — sẽ crash nếu gọi từ hardware thread
CurrentPosition = newPosition;

// ✅ ĐÚNG — dispatch về UI thread
Application.Current.Dispatcher.InvokeAsync(() =>
    SetProperty(ref _currentPosition, newPosition));

// HOẶC dùng helper:
DispatchIfNeeded(() => CurrentPosition = newPosition);
```

### R-UI-03: Command với CanExecute
```csharp
// Luôn define CanExecute cho buttons quan trọng
[RelayCommand(CanExecute = nameof(CanStartMachine))]
private async Task StartMachine() { ... }

private bool CanStartMachine() =>
    !IsMachineRunning && IsHardwareReady && HasActiveRecipe;
```

### R-UI-04: Không hardcode string trong XAML (CỨNG)
```xml
<!-- ❌ SAI -->
<TextBlock Text="Alarm List"/>

<!-- ✅ ĐÚNG -->
<TextBlock Text="{lang:Text Key='Alarm.List.Title'}"/>
```

### R-UI-05: Không hardcode màu trong XAML (CỨNG)
```xml
<!-- ❌ SAI -->
<Border Background="#252525"/>

<!-- ✅ ĐÚNG -->
<Border Background="{DynamicResource Panel.BackgroundBrush}"/>
```

