## SECURITY RULES

### R-SEC-01: Password hashing (CỨNG)
```csharp
// KHÔNG bao giờ lưu plaintext password
// KHÔNG dùng MD5/SHA1 để hash password
// LUÔN dùng BCrypt với work factor ≥ 10
BCrypt.Net.BCrypt.HashPassword(password, workFactor: 12);
```

### R-SEC-02: Audit log bắt buộc cho các action
```
// Phải audit log (không được bỏ qua):
- LOGIN / LOGOUT / LOGIN_FAILED
- PARAMETER_CHANGED (key, old, new, user)
- RECIPE_LOADED / RECIPE_SAVED
- ALARM_ACKNOWLEDGED / ALARM_CLEARED
- MACHINE_STARTED / MACHINE_STOPPED
- USER_CREATED / USER_MODIFIED / USER_DELETED
- INTERLOCK_OVERRIDE
```

### R-SEC-03: Permission check trước action nguy hiểm
```csharp
// Luôn check permission trong ViewModel trước khi call service
if (!_permission.HasPermission(_currentUser, Permission.EditParameter))
    throw new UnauthorizedAccessException("Insufficient permission");
```

---

## DATABASE RULES

### R-DB-01: Repository pattern (CỨNG)
- KHÔNG bao giờ inject DbContext vào Service trực tiếp
- LUÔN dùng Repository interface
- DbContext lifetime: Scoped (mỗi operation tạo mới)

### R-DB-02: No raw SQL (mặc định)
```csharp
// ❌ Tránh trừ khi cần performance đặc biệt
_context.Database.ExecuteSqlRaw("DELETE FROM ...");

// ✅ Dùng EF Core LINQ
await _context.AlarmHistory.Where(a => a.Timestamp < cutoff).ExecuteDeleteAsync();
```

### R-DB-03: Bắt buộc Index cho các column hay query
```csharp
// Trong OnModelCreating:
entity.HasIndex(p => p.Timestamp);           // Mọi bảng có Timestamp
entity.HasIndex(p => p.SerialNumber);         // Production records
entity.HasIndex(p => new { p.Code, p.Station }); // Alarm history
```

---

## TESTING RULES

### R-TEST-01: Mọi Service public method phải có unit test
- Coverage tối thiểu: AlarmService ≥ 90%, Services ≥ 80%, ViewModel ≥ 70%
- Test file đặt song song: AlarmService.cs → AlarmServiceTests.cs

### R-TEST-02: AAA Pattern bắt buộc
```csharp
[Fact]
public async Task MethodName_Scenario_ExpectedResult()
{
    // Arrange
    // Act
    // Assert
}
// Tên test: {Method}_{Điều kiện}_{Kết quả mong đợi}
```

### R-TEST-03: Mock hardware trong test (CỨNG)
- KHÔNG bao giờ kết nối hardware thật trong unit/integration test
- Luôn dùng Mock<IMotionController>, SimulatedController

---

## WHAT TO ALWAYS DO (khi tạo code mới)

1. ✅ Thêm file header comment
2. ✅ Thêm XML doc cho public members
3. ✅ Implement IDisposable nếu subscribe event hoặc hold unmanaged resource
4. ✅ Dùng CancellationToken cho mọi async method
5. ✅ Dùng interface type cho field/parameter (IAlarmService, không AlarmService)
6. ✅ Thêm null check ở constructor: ArgumentNullException.ThrowIfNull(service)
7. ✅ Log đầu vào hàm quan trọng: _logger.LogDebug("Starting {Method}", nameof(...))
8. ✅ Đặt timeout cho hardware call
9. ✅ Gọi DispatchIfNeeded khi update property từ background thread
10. ✅ Viết unit test song song với implementation

## WHAT TO NEVER DO

1. ❌ new() hardware class trực tiếp trong WorkStation hay Service
2. ❌ Bỏ qua CancellationToken trong loop
3. ❌ Thread.Sleep() trong code production
4. ❌ catch (Exception) { } — nuốt exception
5. ❌ Hardcode IP, path, credential trong code
6. ❌ Console.WriteLine() — dùng ILogger
7. ❌ Gọi hardware từ UI thread
8. ❌ Lưu password dạng plaintext hoặc MD5/SHA1
9. ❌ Hardcode màu, string trong XAML
10. ❌ Import System.Windows.* trong ViewModel
11. ❌ Reference implementation class thay vì interface
12. ❌ Commit file *.db, *.log, hardware.json vào Git

---

## ALARM CODE RANGES (tham chiếu nhanh)
```
10000–10999  Motion / Axis
20000–20999  Vision / Camera
30000–30999  I/O / Sensor
40000–40999  System / Application
50000–50999  Communication / Network
60000–60999  Production / Recipe
70000–70999  Safety / Interlock
```

## PROJECT PREFIXES
```
AM.Core.Abstractions     — Interfaces only, no dependencies
AM.Core                  — Enums, Models, StateMachine, Constants
AM.Infrastructure        — Logging, I18n, Security, Config
AM.Data                  — EF Entities, Repositories, DbContext
AM.CommonTools           — Pure utilities, no domain knowledge
AM.Hardware.*            — Device-specific drivers
AM.Services              — Business logic services
AM.Modules.*             — Prism UI modules
AM.WorkStation.*         — Machine-specific sequence (CHANGE THIS)
AM.Application.Shell     — Entry point, DI bootstrap
```
